flowchart LR
 A[Frontend source change] --> B[Fingerprint changed routes]
 B --> C[Capture approved UI screenshots]
 C --> D[Compare image hashes]
 D --> E[Regenerate affected manual sections]
 E --> F[Render DOCX/PDF]
 F --> G[Visual + structural QA]
 G --> H{Changed?}
 H -- Yes --> I[Open documentation update PR]
 H -- No --> J[No-op]
 I --> K[Human review + publish]
